[
  {
    "id": "dimension-ground-y",
    "title": "维度真实 GroundY：已生成区域逐行读取",
    "host": "any",
    "target": "allOfType:LevelGeneration.LG_Zone",
    "steps": [
      {
        "read": [
          "Pointer",
          "name",
          "DimensionIndex",
          "LocalIndex",
          "Dimension.Pointer",
          "Dimension.CreationOrderIndex",
          "Dimension.GroundY",
          "Dimension.DimensionLevel.name"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "requires": [
      "FactoryDone 后玩家落地，独立 Authoring 会话且实验对象为空。"
    ],
    "notes": [
      "Dimension.GroundY 来自当前 IL2CPP dump 的真实 getter；不按维度编号计算高度。每关按 DimensionIndex、CreationOrderIndex、Pointer 分组，同一维度读数必须一致。",
      "allOfType 不覆盖 inactive 或没有 Zone 的维度，摘要会受现有预算限制；完整维度覆盖仍须与同次 floor.m_dimensions 及地形清单对账。截断、读取错误、无样本均未证。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "floor-dimension-inventory",
    "title": "维度清单：核对生成 floor 的维度数量",
    "host": "any",
    "target": "static:LevelGeneration.Builder",
    "steps": [
      {
        "call": "CurrentFloor"
      },
      {
        "target": "result",
        "read": [
          "m_dimensions.Count",
          "m_dimensions"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "notes": [
      "已核 CurrentFloor 与 m_dimensions 真源；清单是覆盖分母，不从关卡定义猜高度。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "enemy-marker-association",
    "target": "allOfType:Enemies.EnemyAgent",
    "steps": [
      {
        "read": [
          "Pointer",
          "GlobalID",
          "Alive",
          "EnemyData.persistentID",
          "IsTagged",
          "WasTagged",
          "EnemyTaggedTimer",
          "m_tagMarker.Pointer",
          "m_tagMarker.m_trackingObj.Pointer",
          "gameObject.Pointer"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "H9 原生状态观察：enemy-marker-association",
    "host": "any",
    "requires": [
      "独立 Authoring 会话，实验对象为空且无 running 命令；主客机逐阶段分别运行。"
    ],
    "notes": [
      "来源为当前 IL2CPP dump 的成员声明。Pointer/GlobalID/UID/EventID 只用于同端当次关联，不是跨生命身份证明。",
      "每端按基线、单项贡献、重叠贡献、撤销单层、原生 recall/迟加入/检查点/迁移、恢复后阶段采样，并保留完整 rec 会话与 Forge 因果日志。未知、无对象、缺字段、截断、身份无法唯一配对均为未证；不能因此解锁接管。",
      "玩家 IsEnabled 不是控制锁开关；武器当前值不是原始基线或贡献归属。此命令不产生控制锁/标记/波次/修改，不改变现有迁移拒绝。"
    ]
  },
